              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Costume Design: Mary, Scenic Design: Paul, Lighting Design: Hudson, Sound Design: Caroline."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Movement Director: David, Artistic Director: Janet, Casting Director: Thomas, Marketing Director: Holly"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f23e30b70e6bfa80"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
