              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Climb up to the themed box on the second floor and embark on a romantic and wonderful theatrical journey."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Designed by Paul, set designer of"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Stardust Rose"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ", there are romantic floral designs in the same style as the play in the box."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Themed boxes can seat up to 8 spectators, and a limited number of 10 packages will be sold daily."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "List price: 23,000 shield"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7876d1f00be53587"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Stardust Rose"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "commemorative frame"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Rose design frame modeled on the original rose prop from the play."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A special release for audience members who love stage plays, with reserved programs and ticket display cards."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Decorate your wall with your"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Stardust Rose"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "program and your ticket!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "List price: 1000 shield"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-d67f582cc7319d30"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Stardust Rose"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "playbill binder"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The cover of the binder is printed with the playbill of"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Stardust Rose"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The size of the binder perfectly matches the size of the program, with a generous 30 pages of storage."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Practical and highly memorable, suitable for storing your theater programs."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "List price: 1500 shield"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7bd92b5b4d22cec5"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
